    "id": "plural/count-conditional-shown-in-fallback",
    "note": "The lenient fallback prints the count as the plural stage saw it -- resolved. Pins WHERE the resolution happens (before every check, not just before the numeric test), which is what makes the fallback text comparable across engines.",
    "kind": "deterministic",
    "op": "render",
